WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:03.840
Welcome to Second Drink, The Alliance.
欢迎来到《Second Drink, The Alliance》。

2
00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:07.820
Jenna, I feel like we need a cat calendar at front reception update.
珍娜，我觉得前台的猫咪挂历该换了。

3
00:00:08.740 --> 00:00:11.340
Well, they really made me wait for it this week.
好吧，这周他们确实让我等了好久。

4
00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:15.820
It's there, but you don't see it till 12 minutes and 50 seconds.
挂历在那儿，但你得等到12分50秒才能看到。

5
00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:17.280
Cat calendar at reception.
前台的猫咪挂历。

6
00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:20.460
Yeah, yeah, same calendar, same cat, by the way.
没错，没错，顺便说一下，还是那本挂历，还是那只猫。

7
00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:22.320
The month has not changed.
月份根本没变。

8
00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:22.920
No flips.
没翻页。

9
00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:23.500
Nope.
没翻。

10
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:30.080
There is also, next to the cat calendar, a giant poster that says,
而且在猫咪挂历旁边，还有一张巨大的海报，上面写着：

11
00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:34.260
All Hands Meeting on Saturday from 9 a.m.
周六上午9点召开全员大会，

12
00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:34.660
to noon.
一直到中午。

13
00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:36.700
It's been there for weeks.
那张海报已经贴了好几周了。

14
00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:38.520
What are we meeting about?
我们要开什么会？

15
00:00:38.740 --> 00:00:39.320
I don't know.
我不知道。

16
00:00:39.340 --> 00:00:40.740
And are we meeting every Saturday?
我们是每个周六都要开会吗？

17
00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:41.780
It doesn't specify.
上面没写。

18
00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:45.220
And, spoiler alert, I checked ahead.
而且，剧透预警，我提前查过了。

19
00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:50.620
Both the cat calendar and the All Hands Meeting are there through the end of Season 1.
猫咪挂历和全员大会的海报一直都在，直到第一季结束。

20
00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:52.080
Noted.
知道了。

21
00:00:52.240 --> 00:00:52.620
All right.
好吧。

22
00:00:52.620 --> 00:00:55.200
Well, we'll have to see if they're in Season 2.
那我们得看看第二季里还有没有它们。

23
00:00:55.460 --> 00:00:56.780
You know I'll look for it.
你知道我会去留意的。

24
00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:01.340
Well, I found a fun Michael talking head that was in the table read draft for this episode.
我发现了一段有趣的迈克尔独白，是在这一集的剧本围读草稿里的。

25
00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:07.480
It reveals Michael's philosophy about sales and worker morale, how they're connected.
它揭示了迈克尔关于销售和员工士气之间联系的哲学。

26
00:01:07.480 --> 00:01:08.300
And you know what?
你知道吗？

27
00:01:08.380 --> 00:01:10.540
It sets up the whole birthday storyline.
它为整个生日剧情线做了铺垫。

28
00:01:10.540 --> 00:01:12.080
And I wanted to read it to you.
我想读给你听。

29
00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:12.940
Oh, okay.
哦，好的。

30
00:01:13.520 --> 00:01:15.180
Michael looks at camera and says,
迈克尔看向镜头说：

31
00:01:15.380 --> 00:01:18.300
All salesmen are selling one thing.
所有的销售员都在卖一样东西。

32
00:01:19.660 --> 00:01:20.180
Happiness.
快乐。

33
00:01:20.920 --> 00:01:21.960
And ourselves.
还有我们自己。

34
00:01:21.960 --> 00:01:23.880
Look at TV ads now.
看看现在的电视广告。

35
00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:26.720
A guy in a tuxedo breakdancing in a park.
一个穿燕尾服的家伙在公园里跳霹雳舞。

36
00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:29.260
And four hot girls jumping in a puddle.
还有四个辣妹在水坑里跳来跳去。

37
00:01:29.520 --> 00:01:30.920
And what are they selling?
他们在卖什么？

38
00:01:31.560 --> 00:01:32.560
I don't know.
我不知道。

39
00:01:33.260 --> 00:01:34.520
Could be coffee.
可能是咖啡。

40
00:01:34.840 --> 00:01:35.840
Could be typewriters.
可能是打字机。

41
00:01:36.040 --> 00:01:37.340
It's a lifestyle.
这是一种生活方式。

42
00:01:37.640 --> 00:01:39.180
The happiness lifestyle.
快乐的生活方式。

43
00:01:44.240 --> 00:01:49.220
The problem I'm facing is there's a lot of rumors going through the office about downsizing.
我面临的问题是，办公室里流传着很多关于裁员的谣言。

44
00:01:49.460 --> 00:01:51.680
Everyone is worried about losing their job.
每个人都担心丢掉工作。

45
00:01:51.680 --> 00:01:57.480
It's brought our happiness level to whoo, whoo, whoo, down to here.
这让我们的快乐指数，呜——呜——呜——降到了这里。

46
00:01:57.840 --> 00:01:59.940
The bomb falling whistle was in the script.
剧本里写了炸弹落下的哨音。

47
00:02:00.200 --> 00:02:00.420
Okay.
好吧。

48
00:02:00.420 --> 00:02:01.100
That's why I did it.
所以我才那样做了。

49
00:02:01.680 --> 00:02:03.420
Jenna's looking at me like, what are you doing?
珍娜正看着我，心想你在干什么？

50
00:02:03.680 --> 00:02:05.000
You said to do that.
是你让我那样做的。

51
00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:06.360
It's brought it down to here.
它已经降到这里了。

52
00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:07.100
Not good.
不太妙。

53
00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:09.460
Time to call in a specialiSt.
是时候请专家出马了。

54
00:02:10.280 --> 00:02:11.160
Professor me.
也就是我。

55
00:02:11.780 --> 00:02:16.400
And then the scene would have continued with Michael and Pam in his office where he says
然后这一幕本应继续，迈克尔和帕姆在办公室里，他说

56
00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:19.120
that they need to boost morale by hosting a birthday party.
他们需要通过举办生日派对来提振士气。

57
00:02:19.640 --> 00:02:20.180
Wow.
哇。

58
00:02:20.560 --> 00:02:23.140
I love so much when he's like, what are they selling?
我特别喜欢他说“他们在卖什么？”的时候。

59
00:02:23.340 --> 00:02:24.380
I don't know.
我不知道。

60
00:02:24.960 --> 00:02:25.880
Could be coffee.
可能是咖啡。

61
00:02:25.880 --> 00:02:27.060
Could be typewriters.
可能是打字机。

62
00:02:28.820 --> 00:02:30.300
And there's one other thing.
还有一件事。

63
00:02:30.820 --> 00:02:35.280
You know, Jenna, in this breakdown of this episode, you mention a deleted scene between
你知道吗，珍娜，在这个剧集的解析中，你提到了一个被删减的片段，发生在

64
00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:38.860
Michael and Pam where he is coaching her on how to answer the phones.
迈克尔和帕姆之间，他正在教她如何接听电话。

65
00:02:38.900 --> 00:02:39.520
Oh, yes.
哦，是的。

66
00:02:39.520 --> 00:02:41.560
I remember shooting it even now.
直到现在我还记得拍摄时的情景。

67
00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:43.360
Well, it's really funny.
嗯，真的很有趣。

68
00:02:43.960 --> 00:02:48.080
And you describe it so well, but we didn't play the clip, and I think we should hear it.
你描述得很好，但我们没放那个片段，我觉得我们应该听听看。

69
00:02:48.220 --> 00:02:48.680
I agree.
我同意。

70
00:02:52.790 --> 00:02:54.170
Dunder Mifflin, this is Pam.
邓德·米福林公司，我是帕姆。

71
00:02:55.310 --> 00:02:56.070
Hold, please.
请稍候。

72
00:02:57.490 --> 00:02:57.950
Ew.
呃。

73
00:02:58.610 --> 00:02:59.750
Oh, rainy then.
哦，那是个雨天。

74
00:02:59.750 --> 00:03:02.930
Well, I see you're going for the whole board supermodel thing.
嗯，我看你是想走那种全能超模路线。

75
00:03:03.730 --> 00:03:05.270
Dunder Mifflin, this is Pam.
邓德·米福林公司，我是帕姆。

76
00:03:05.570 --> 00:03:06.170
May I help you?
有什么可以帮您的吗？

77
00:03:06.950 --> 00:03:08.150
Smoke, smoke, smoke, smoke.
烟，烟，烟，烟。

78
00:03:08.630 --> 00:03:09.910
I wasn't really going for anything.
我其实没想走什么路线。

79
00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:10.510
I get it.
我懂了。

80
00:03:10.630 --> 00:03:10.830
I get it.
我懂了。

81
00:03:11.030 --> 00:03:11.950
A child is born.
一个孩子出生了。

82
00:03:13.590 --> 00:03:14.390
Beautiful sunset.
美丽的日落。

83
00:03:14.650 --> 00:03:15.390
I'll catch the next one.
我会赶上下一班的。

84
00:03:15.530 --> 00:03:15.930
Right?
对吧？

85
00:03:16.330 --> 00:03:17.590
Unicorn walks into the office.
独角兽走进办公室。

86
00:03:18.270 --> 00:03:19.130
Oh, do you have an appointment?
哦，您有预约吗？

87
00:03:20.390 --> 00:03:24.330
Look, Pam, this is not meant as a criticism, but let me tell you what you're doing wrong.
听着，帕姆，这并不是批评，但让我告诉你你哪里做错了。

88
00:03:24.950 --> 00:03:26.990
You're the voice of this company, right?
你是这家公司的代言人，对吧？

89
00:03:26.990 --> 00:03:32.350
And when clients call and you're not smiling, they can hear that in your voice.
当客户打电话来而你没有微笑时，他们能从你的声音里听出来。

90
00:03:32.350 --> 00:03:34.030
It is a real turn-off.
这真的很让人反感。

91
00:03:34.950 --> 00:03:36.090
Are you being serious?
你是认真的吗？

92
00:03:36.790 --> 00:03:37.910
Yes, I am.
是的，我是认真的。

93
00:03:38.050 --> 00:03:38.410
Absolutely.
绝对是。

94
00:03:38.790 --> 00:03:40.910
So, the next call we get, I'd like you to smile.
所以，下一个电话打进来时，我希望你能微笑。

95
00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:41.990
I'd like to see a big smile.
我想看到一个大大的微笑。

96
00:03:42.790 --> 00:03:43.190
Okay.
好吧。

97
00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:43.570
Okay.
好吧。

98
00:03:54.370 --> 00:03:55.210
No one's calling.
没人打电话来。

99
00:03:55.230 --> 00:03:55.510
I know.
我知道。

100
00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:55.990
Somebody will.
总会有人打来的。

101
00:03:56.350 --> 00:03:57.150
And we'll wait.
我们会等的。

102
00:04:02.140 --> 00:04:04.100
Sometimes there's a lot of time between the calls.
有时候电话之间会有很长的空档。

103
00:04:04.320 --> 00:04:04.620
I knew.
我知道。

104
00:04:04.780 --> 00:04:05.100
I knew.
我知道。

105
00:04:05.300 --> 00:04:06.220
We will wait.
我们会等的。

106
00:04:06.360 --> 00:04:06.580
Okay.
好的。

107
00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:08.620
We will wait for the call.
我们会等电话的。

108
00:04:09.580 --> 00:04:10.680
And you will smile.
而你会微笑。

109
00:04:11.180 --> 00:04:14.880
Let me try something, just while we're waiting.
趁我们等待的时候，让我试个东西。

110
00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:15.400
Okay.
好的。

111
00:04:16.080 --> 00:04:17.780
Tell me if I'm smiling or not.
告诉我我有没有在笑。

112
00:04:18.860 --> 00:04:19.540
Hi, Pam.
嗨，帕姆。

113
00:04:19.660 --> 00:04:20.100
How are you?
你好吗？

114
00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:21.160
Was I smiling?
我刚才在笑吗？

115
00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:22.140
Yes.
是的。

116
00:04:22.460 --> 00:04:22.680
Okay.
好的。

117
00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:23.480
Let me try this one.
让我试试这个。

118
00:04:24.480 --> 00:04:25.140
Hi, Pam.
嗨，帕姆。

119
00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:25.660
How are you?
你好吗？

120
00:04:25.800 --> 00:04:26.040
No.
没有。

121
00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:26.920
I mean, you can tell.
我是说，你看得出来。

122
00:04:27.020 --> 00:04:27.260
Yeah.
是啊。

123
00:04:27.520 --> 00:04:28.080
I could tell.
我看得出来。

124
00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:28.720
I wasn't smiling that time.
那次我没在笑。

125
00:04:28.880 --> 00:04:30.120
And they can tell, too.
他们也看得出来。

126
00:04:30.900 --> 00:04:31.920
That was a good example.
那是个很好的例子。

127
00:04:32.140 --> 00:04:32.440
Thank you.
谢谢。

128
00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:37.360
All right.
好吧。

129
00:04:38.260 --> 00:04:40.640
When we get a call, I'll come back, and you'll do the smile.
等我们接到电话，我会回来，然后你再做那个微笑。

130
00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:41.160
Okay.
好的。

131
00:04:44.790 --> 00:04:45.850
It's shitting time!
该拉屎了！

132
00:04:49.150 --> 00:04:50.450
Dunder Mifflin, this is Pam.
邓德·米夫林，我是帕姆。

133
00:04:50.450 --> 00:04:52.410
Pam, one moment.
帕姆，稍等一下。

134
00:04:52.410 --> 00:04:53.170
