然后他们就一直开着摄像机录。

142
00:05:11.270 --> 00:05:15.930
And that's why I said, sometimes there's a long time between calls.
所以我才说，有时候电话之间会有很长的空档。

143
00:05:16.530 --> 00:05:18.230
Because you're like, what are we doing?
因为你会想，我们到底在干嘛？

144
00:05:18.330 --> 00:05:18.810
Yes.
是的。

145
00:05:18.810 --> 00:05:23.510
And then Steve improvised that whole thing where he, like, puts his hands up in front of his face.
然后史蒂夫即兴发挥了整段戏，他把手举到脸前。

146
00:05:23.570 --> 00:05:25.330
